{"id":"wb-6-502","name":"吉林文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"吉林文庙","text":"吉林文庙位于中国吉林省吉林市昌邑区南昌路2号，是清朝在东北建立的第一座孔庙，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n吉林文庙始建于清乾隆元年（1736年），宣统元年（1909年）移至现址并扩建。文庙坐北朝南，占地16354平方米，建筑面积2997平方米。中轴线上有照壁、泮池、状元桥、棂星门、大成门、大成殿、崇圣殿等建筑，两侧有东西辕门、金声门、玉振门、东西官厅、省牲厅、祭乐器库、名宦祠、乡贤祠等建筑。主体建筑大成殿面阔十一间、进深五间，重檐歇山顶，殿前有月台。崇圣殿面阔七间，单檐歇山顶。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%89%E6%9E%97%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92759833,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92759833","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dc7c1660fb5e7b208d09a127.jpg","title":"Confucian_temple,_Jilin_City_9.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Confucian_temple,_Jilin_City_9.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/Confucian_temple%2C_Jilin_City_9.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"H2v5o68z","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​Confucian temple, Jilin City","width":320,"height":240}}